# Generate Priya foundation conveyor v6

## Goal

Generate one identity-preserving course scene at `course-assets/scenes/module-19/m19_L19_b02_foundation-conveyor-v6.png`.

## Scope

- Edit the approved foundation conveyor composition without changing its left-to-right qualification meaning.
- Use `course-assets/scenes/module-19/_anchors/priya-canonical-v6.png` as the highest-priority Priya identity and body reference.
- Use the supplied style, cast, and object boards only to constrain the BMH doodle language.
- Keep exactly one person and exactly three integrated labels: `RAW LEAD`, `QUALIFICATION`, and `QUALIFIED LEAD`.
- Remove alarm rays, loose punctuation, ambient doodles, decorative filler, extra props, gradients, texture, shading, shadows, lighting effects, and perspective.
- Preserve the locked palette and require pure white visible skin.
- Save a 1600 x 900 PNG at the exact requested versioned path.

## Verification

- Confirm PNG format and 1600 x 900 dimensions.
- Visually inspect Priya against the v6 anchor for head, neck, torso, pants, legs, ponytail, headband, headset, top, shoes, face, and hands.
- Confirm exactly one person, the before-to-after conveyor meaning, and no clipped subject.
- Confirm the only readable text is the three exact approved labels.
- Confirm the flat BMH doodle style and prohibited-effect constraints.

